DESCRIPTION:Live DJ!\nTickets: $25 single ticket / $200 Table for 4 / $300
  Table for 6\nTickets are purchased through Duke University's Box Office.
  Ticket packages & discounts do not apply. This is a fundraiser event\, a
 nd all proceeds support the ADF scholarship fund.\nRecommended for ages 1
 6+ \n\nThe 2026 Season Opening Dance Party will take place at the JB Duke
  Hotel Lobby Bar immediately following the opening night performance. Dan
 ce the night away with Jesse Factor! Each ticket includes unlimited danci
 ng to a live DJ and a free dessert bar. Drinks will be available for purc
 hase. A limited number of tables are available for purchase for groups of
  4 for $200 and for groups of 6 for $300. ($25 single tickets do not incl
 ude seating.)\n\nPhoto credit: Ben McKeown
DURATION:PT2H
